5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Hello everyone. It is a pleasure to gather and discuss this. To ensure we create a home where everyone feels comfortable and fair, I suggest we look at the facts first.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree, Servas. It's important that we all feel comfortable. I think starting with the facts will help us find a balanced solution that keeps everyone happy.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I agree too. I want everyone to be happy and not feel sad or upset. What kind of facts should we look at first?,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I'm with you all! Let's keep it light but fair. I want to see exactly where our money is going before we jump into any big changes. What do you guys think?,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I agree. Maybe we should look at how we've been doing things... and if there's a way to make the process easier for whoever has to manage it.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Since we seek a harmony that lasts through all seasons, I believe we should examine the ""Payment log for the last twelve months"" and the ""Sunlight and heating need by room."" What do you all think?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"Those sound like a great start, Servas. I'm interested in the ""Payment log for the last twelve months"" as well, and I'd also like to see the ""The last twelve utility statements"" to understand the totals.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I want to know if things are really fair for everyone. Can I look at the ""Payment log for the last twelve months"" and the ""Plug-in monitor readings room by room""?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"I'll go with ""The last twelve utility statements"" and the ""Electrician's quote for the rooms."" I want to see the yearly flow and if any upgrades would cost us a fortune upfront!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think I'll look at the ""Trial run of a reconciliation template"" and the ""Monthly settle observed at another house."" I just want to see if there's a simpler way to handle the paperwork.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,"It seems we have a diverse set of interests. By looking at both the numbers and the physical needs of our rooms, we shall find a path that honors everyone's comfort.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,I think it's wonderful that we're considering both the technical side and the human side of this. It will help us avoid any misunderstandings and keep our home a peaceful place for everyone.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I hope that by looking at the logs and the monitors, we can find out if anyone is feeling burdened. I just want us all to be honest and kind to each other.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"Exactly! Honesty is key, but so is the bottom line. I'm curious to see if our current system is just a mess or if we're actually overpaying. Let's see what the data tells us!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope the template helps. I just don't want anyone to feel too stressed out by the calculations every month. It seems like a lot of work.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Let us proceed with these choices. As we gather this information, let us remember that the numbers are merely tools to help us care for one another more effectively. I look forward to our findings.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,I agree. Let's use this information to build a system that supports us all. I'm looking forward to seeing what we find so we can move forward together in harmony.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minato,,I'm looking forward to it too. I hope we can all feel relaxed and happy with whatever we decide. Let's be very gentle with each other when we talk about the results.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,"I'm all for being gentle, but let's not be afraid of the truth! I can't wait to see those statements. Let's get to it and see who's actually spending what!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,Okay... I'll do my best to find something that makes things easier for everyone. I hope we can find a way that isn't too stressful.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
