35,2,1,talk,Servas,,It appears that our home has different needs depending on the room and the season. We must ensure that no one feels they must suffer in the cold to keep the peace.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,"I've noticed that our monthly totals fluctuate quite a bit, and some payments have been delayed after questions were asked. I'm worried that the way we handle money might be causing some hidden tension between us.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,"I saw that some payments were late because people were confused. Also, the monitor showed that some rooms use much more electricity than others. Does that mean some of us are paying for other people's heaters?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"@Minato, you hit the nail on the head! I saw the statements, and the costs are all over the place—February was nearly 30,000 yen while August was under 10,000. It's a total rollercoaster!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... I looked into some other ways of doing things. But... it seems like even with a template or separate meters, it still takes a lot of time and effort to organize everything every month.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"It is natural for costs to fluctuate with the seasons, but our hearts should not. If some rooms are colder, we must acknowledge that burden openly so no one suffers in silence.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Servas, I agree. But I'm also concerned that the confusion over payments is creating a distance between us. If we only focus on the temperature, we might miss the emotional toll these disputes are taking.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"I don't want anyone to feel like they are being treated unfairly. If some people use much more electricity, maybe it's okay, but we should talk about it so nobody feels upset or burdened.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Midori, emotional toll is one thing, but my wallet is feeling the real pain! Those winter spikes are brutal. If we want a ""fair"" fix, we need to decide if we're paying for actual use or just splitting the chaos.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree with May that the spikes are hard. But if we make the system too complicated to be ""fair,"" I'm worried the person doing the math will just be exhausted. Is there a simpler way?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,"Simplicity is a virtue, @Daisuke, but not at the cost of truth. If we ignore the reality of our cold rooms, we risk a winter of quiet resentment. Let us find a balance between ease and honesty.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, I understand wanting to keep it simple, but if we ignore the friction we've already had, it will only come back. We need a system that is clear enough to prevent those awkward arguments and delays.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"I think we should be honest about the electricity use. If we just keep it simple but it's not fair, will people still be sad? I want us to find a way where everyone feels okay.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, exactly! Being ""simple"" doesn't help if we're all stressed about the money. But let's be real—installing sub-meters would cost us a fortune upfront. Is that really the ""gentle"" way to handle this?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I just mean that if the system is too complex, the person managing it might feel overwhelmed. I don't want anyone to be stressed by the paperwork every single month. Maybe there's a middle ground?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,"Let us remember that the most expensive cost is a home where one feels unwelcome. Whether through a simple agreement or a detailed log, our goal is a warmth that reaches every room and every heart.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,"I agree, Servas. Let's make sure our final decision doesn't just solve the math, but also heals the tension. A clear, transparent system will be the kindest thing for our relationships in the long run.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,"I hope we can all agree on something that makes everyone feel seen. If we are honest about how much we use, maybe the tension will go away and we can all be happy again.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,"I'm all for transparency, but let's not overcomplicate it. We need a system that handles those winter spikes without breaking the bank or our spirits. I'm ready to see the options and pick the smartest one!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I hope we can find a way that doesn't put too much pressure on one person. I'll support whatever we decide, as long as it doesn't make anyone's life too difficult.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
