60,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Option A offers the most truth, but Option B provides a predictable peace. I worry that a flat share may lead some to freeze in silence to save others money. Which path honors us all?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Midori,,"@Servas, I agree that Option C might lead to resentment. However, Option A could be too clinical. Option B seems like a gentle middle ground that prevents those monthly payment disputes by making costs predictable.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minato,,"I think Option A is the most honest because it shows exactly who uses what. If we use Option C, will the people who use less electricity still feel like they are carrying others?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,"@Minato, you're right about the fairness, but Option A is a total money pit upfront! I'm leaning towards Option B. It stops those scary winter spikes from hitting us all at once. Predictability is a luxury I need!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... Option A sounds like it would be a lot of work to manage every month. Option B seems easier, but the year-end settlement might be a huge headache. Maybe Option C is the simplest for everyone?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, simplicity is a comfort, but a flat share may be a mask for unfairness. If we choose Option C, we must promise to speak up when the cold becomes too much to bear.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, I understand the appeal of Option C, but we've already seen that simple splits can lead to confusion and tension. Option B removes the monthly guesswork, which I think is the best way to protect our friendships.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Midori, I like that it protects our friendships. But if we use Option B, will we still be hiding the truth about who uses the most? I just want to make sure nobody is secretly upset.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, we can't avoid every single secret, but Option B stops the monthly panic! Option A is way too expensive to install, and Option C is just a recipe for more arguments. Let's go with B!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'm worried that Option B just pushes all the hard work to the end of the year. But if Option C causes more arguments, maybe B is better. I just hope the year-end part isn't too stressful.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Servas,,"If we choose Option B, we must agree to handle the year-end settlement with grace and openness. Let us not let a final sum overshadow the peace we have cultivated throughout the year.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Midori,,"@Servas, exactly. If we commit to that openness, Option B solves the immediate friction. It stops the monthly accusations and gives us a stable foundation, which is exactly what our relationships need right now.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minato,,"I think Option B is a good idea if it makes everyone feel safe. As long as we are honest at the end of the year, I'm happy to vote for it.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, now we're talking! It's the smartest move. We avoid the massive installation fees of A and the monthly chaos of C. Let's just lock in B and breathe easy!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I guess Option B is the best compromise. It's not perfect, but it's better than the monthly stress of Option C or the constant tracking of Option A. I'll vote for B.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Servas,,"It is heartening to see us reach a consensus. Let us choose Option B, and pledge to treat the year-end settlement as a moment of shared reflection and kindness. I vote for Option B.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Midori,,"I agree completely. By choosing Option B, we prioritize our harmony and remove the monthly triggers for conflict. I'm happy we've found a way to protect our friendships. I vote for Option B.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Minato,,I'm glad we all agree and that everyone feels okay with this. I want us to stay friends and be kind to each other. I vote for Option B too!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,May,,Finally! A decision that doesn't break the bank or my brain. Predictability is exactly what I was looking for. Let's make it official—I vote for Option B!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll vote for Option B as well. I hope we can find a way to make the year-end part simple so it doesn't become too much for anyone. I vote for Option B.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
